5,1,1,talk,Mio,,Hi everyone! I'm so excited to get started! I really want to make sure we're spending our budget on the right things this time. I'll look into loan transport costs and mount-making charges!,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"I agree that we need a clear picture of our resources. I would like to look into the conservation lab staffing and backlog, as well as the composition of the volunteer roster.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shion,,I think we should prioritize what actually draws people in. I'll look into the weekend head counts across ten seasons and the five years of visitor comment slips.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I believe we must ensure the gallery can physically support the exhibition. I will look into the structural survey of the suspended bay and the evening hire bookings in the gallery.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"It is wonderful to see everyone so focused. I worry about the logistics of our arrivals, so I shall look into the lender paperwork against shipping cut-offs and the maintenance log for powered displays.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mio,,"Does anyone else think we should check the staffing? @Victoria, I'm curious if the volunteers can help with the budget side of things. I'm happy with my choices, so I'll say over!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Mio, volunteers generally handle guest relations rather than finances, but knowing their strengths is vital for the workload. I believe my current selections will provide the clarity we need.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
12,1,2,pass,Victoria,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
13,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Mio, budget is one thing, but popularity is what justifies the spend. I'm satisfied with my choices.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
14,1,2,pass,Shion,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
15,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Mio, budget is important, but physical constraints are non-negotiable. If the gallery cannot accommodate the pieces, the budget becomes irrelevant. I am satisfied with my selections.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
