58,3,1,talk,Mio,,"Oh, look at these! Candidate A seems perfect! It's local, so we save on transport and mounts, and those demonstration sessions give us the human element @Shion wants without needing broken machines!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,1,talk,Victoria,,"I agree with Mio. Candidate A avoids the conservation backlog and high transport costs, while the craftspeople provide the human presence Shion desires without the risks associated with powered displays or heavy rigging.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,1,talk,Shion,,Candidate A is a strong contender. It satisfies the need for a human presence and dynamic interaction without relying on the mechanical failures Shizue warned us about. It seems the most logical choice for engagement.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Asuka,,"Candidate A is the most viable. It avoids the weight risks of Candidate B's rigging and the heavy objects in C or D, and its simple setup is secure against evening hire traffic. I vote for A.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Shizue,,"Candidate A is a lovely choice. It avoids the stress of distant lenders and the trouble of powered displays, while bringing the community together. I also vote for A.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,2,talk,Mio,,It's amazing how we all agree! Candidate A just fits everything we talked about. I'm voting for A too!,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,2,talk,Victoria,,I concur. Candidate A is the only option that respects our staffing limitations and budget constraints while still promising a dynamic experience for our visitors. I vote for A.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Shion,,"I've analyzed the options, and A is the only one that guarantees the human interaction the public craves without the risk of a static, boring gallery. I vote for A.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Asuka,,"Since we have reached a consensus based on the physical and operational constraints of the gallery, there is no need for further debate. My vote remains with Candidate A.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
